    <!-- About screen -->
    <string name="info_app_description">Make your phone stand out.
This is a premium wallpaper app that brings together photo wallpapers, video wallpapers, favorites, downloads, and auto-changing wallpapers—designed for users who love style, motion, and personalization.
Discover a curated collection of high-resolution images and smooth dynamic wallpapers, including nature, abstract, dark, minimal, technology, and artistic styles. Your screen will always feel fresh and unique.
Key Features\n\n

✨ HD Photo Wallpapers\n
High-resolution images for all screen sizes
Set separately for home screen and lock screen\n\n

🎬 Live Video Wallpapers\n
Smooth playback with low battery usage
Add motion and depth to your device\n\n

❤️ Favorites\n
Save your favorite wallpapers
Switch anytime with one tap\n\n

⬇️ Download to Device\n
Save wallpapers locally
Use them even when offline\n\n
🔁 Auto Wallpaper Changer\n
Automatically switch wallpapers on a schedule\n\n
Enjoy a new look every day</string>
